{
  "_comment": [
    "The SSH phone book the bar's SUPER+P panel reads, merged on top of",
    "~/.ssh/config. Copy to ~/.config/neu/ssh.json -- it is deliberately NOT",
    "linked and NOT in this repo, the same arrangement neu-llm.env.example has:",
    "  install -d -m 700 ~/.config/neu",
    "  install -m 600 bin/neu-ssh.json.example ~/.config/neu/ssh.json",
    "A name here shadows the same name in ~/.ssh/config, so a host can be",
    "relabelled or re-pointed without touching ssh's own config.",
    "`group` is optional and only becomes a heading once there is more than one."
  ],
  "hosts": [
    { "name": "flagship",  "user": "jwbla", "host": "192.168.1.4",   "group": "fleet" },
    { "name": "pmox",      "user": "root",  "host": "192.168.1.100", "group": "fleet" },
    { "name": "act-runner","user": "root",  "host": "192.168.1.215", "group": "fleet" },
    { "name": "nas",       "user": "admin", "host": "192.168.1.98",  "port": 2222, "group": "storage" }
  ]
}
